"alignment":"center","margin_top":"no-indent","margin_bottom":"no-indent","padding_top":"m","padding_bottom":"m"}},"grid_sellpoints_image_yTiTkb":{"type":"grid-sellpoints-image","blocks":{"heading_cGMjFL":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Engineered for Total Privacy","heading_size":"large"}},"text_AFph97":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>No cloud. No subscription. Full data control.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_cGMjFL","text_AFph97"],"custom_css":[".rich-text__blocks {background: linear-gradient(to right, #010100, #2b2e32 50%, #010100); margin: 0; max-width: none;}",".rich-text__text {max-width: 1300px;}",".rich-text__heading {max-width: 1300px;}",".grid-imgsbox {margin-top: 6rem !important;}","@media screen and (max-width: 750px) {.grid-imgsbox {margin-top: 4rem !important; }}"],"name":"grid-sellpoints-image","settings":{"pc_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/X1_Pro_Crowdfunding_PC_08.png","mo_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/X1_Pro_Crowdfunding_MO_08.png","color_scheme":"background-4","full_width":true,"alignment":"center","margin_top":"no-indent","margin_bottom":"no-indent","padding_top":"m","padding_bottom":"m"}},"x1_pro_earnest_kKVixW":{"type":"x1-pro-earnest","custom_css":[".rich-text__blocks {background: linear-gradient(to right, #010100, #2b2e32 50%, #010100); margin: 0; max-width: none;}"],"name":"x1-pro-earnest","settings":{"color_scheme":"","full_width":true,"alignment":"center","margin_top":"no-indent","margin_bottom":"no-indent","padding_top":"m","padding_bottom":"m","button_url":"https:\/\/www.kickstarter.com\/projects\/593941944\/baseus-x1-pro-first-smart-ai-dual-tracking-security-camera?ref=3521pt","text1":"Engineered for Total Privacy","text2":"No cloud. No subscription. Full data control.","text3":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0555\/8432\/5709\/files\/X1_PRO_PC.png","text4":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0555\/8432\/5709\/files\/X1_PRO_MOB.png","text5":"Sign up now for updates on new products and a chance at beta testing!","text6":"Unlock the Launch Special when we go live on Kickstarter!","text7":"By signing up, you agree to receive our newsletters."}},"collapsible_content_Qtcjp3":{"type":"collapsible-content","blocks":{"accordion_FAAXXN":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"question":"What are the Kickstarter reward tiers and how much can I save?","answer":"<p>We’re offering three special Kickstarter secret reward tiers:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Secret Reward (1 set):<\/strong> Includes one set with a 64GB card. Regular MSRP is $289.99, but backers can get it for just $139.99, a savings of $150 (51.7% off).<\/li><li><strong>Secret Reward for Two (2 sets):<\/strong> Includes two sets, each with a 64GB card. Regular MSRP is $579.98, but the Kickstarter price is only $259.98, saving you $320 (55.2% off).<\/li><li><strong>Secret Reward for Four (4 sets):<\/strong> Includes four sets, each with a 64GB card. Regular MSRP is $1,159.96, but backers pay just $519.96, saving a big $640 (55.2% off).<\/li><\/ul><p>NOTE: Secret Reward slots are limited and allocated on a <strong>first-come, first-served basis<\/strong>, but there will be <strong>over 1,000 slots available<\/strong>, giving you a very good chance to secure one. Pricing for other tiers beyond the Secret Reward will be announced when the campaign launches.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","opened":true}},"accordion_GJDHyd":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"question":"Can I see prices in other currencies other than USD?","answer":"<p>Yes. Prices are shown in USD by default, but once the Kickstarter campaign launches, you’ll be able to view them in your local currency. The system will automatically convert the final amount using Kickstarter’s regional exchange rates.  The <strong>$2 deposit on our website can also be paid in your local currency<\/strong>, with the final amount converted automatically at checkout.<\/p>","opened":false}},"accordion_xVQUyb":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"question":"Does the secret reward price include shipping and taxes?","answer":"<p>The listed prices do not include shipping or taxes.We’re subsidizing part of the shipping cost to keep it affordable — so no need to worry about high fees.<strong>Free shipping<\/strong> is available for <strong>multi-unit bundles<\/strong> to the <strong>United States, European Union countries, United Kingdom, Canada, Australia, and Switzerland<\/strong>.For single-unit bundles or other regions, shipping fees will be shown at checkout.<\/p>","opened":false}},"accordion_a64U44":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"question":"How can I use the deposit?","answer":"<p>Once the X1 Pro launches on Kickstarter, we will email the exclusive Secret Reward link to the address you used to pay the $2 deposit. Please make sure to use the same email address when placing your order on Kickstarter. When you complete your pledge, your $2 deposit will be applied toward the Secret Reward bundle.<\/p>","opened":false}},"accordion_TCzRxt":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"question":"What are the benefits of paying the deposit?","answer":"<p>Paying the $2 deposit unlocks VIP benefits for the X1 Pro, including a Kickstarter-exclusive reward, an early access link 10 minutes before launch, an exclusive 64GB bundle, insider updates, and access to our early backer community — all with the flexibility to cancel anytime for a full refund.<\/p>","opened":false}},"accordion_6B47pe":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"question":"Is the deposit refundable?","answer":"<p>Yes, your $2 deposit is fully refundable. If you decide not to move forward with purchasing the X1 Pro, you can request a refund anytime by contacting our customer service team at team at <a href=\"mailto:security.global@baseus.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:security.global@baseus.com\"><strong>security.global@baseus.com<\/strong><\/a><\/p>","opened":false}},"accordion_tfnfcz":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"question":"Is there anything I should pay special attention to when placing the deposit order?","answer":"<p>Yes. Please make sure the email address you use to pay the $2 deposit is the same as the one you will use to back the X1 Pro on Kickstarter.<\/p>","opened":false}},"accordion_KJJcUY":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"question":"Will I receive a confirmation email after paying the deposit?","answer":"<p>Yes. Once your $2 deposit payment is successfully processed, you will receive a confirmation email with your order and payment details.<\/p>","opened":false}},"accordion_amdQJW":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"question":"How can I pay the deposit?","answer":"<p>You can pay the $2 deposit through our official online store using credit\/debit cards, PayPal, or other supported payment methods at checkout.<\/p>","opened":false}},"accordion_GymaMU":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"question":"Can I buy multiple X1 Pro units and still get the $129.99 Secret Reward price?","answer":"<ul><li>Yes. Our Secret Reward tiers are structured as follows: <strong>1 unit at $139.99<\/strong>, and <strong>2-unit and 4-unit bundles at $129.99 per unit<\/strong> (each with a 64GB card). One <strong>$2 deposit<\/strong> unlocks <strong>one pledge (one reward tier)<\/strong>. If you want more units <strong>at the $129.99 rate<\/strong>, please place <strong>additional deposits<\/strong> to secure additional <strong>2-unit or 4-unit Secret Reward bundles<\/strong>.  Please note: On Kickstarter, each account can select <strong>one reward tier<\/strong> per pledge. If you plan to back <strong>multiple tiers<\/strong> (e.g., one 2-unit and one 4-unit bundle), you’ll need to use <strong>separate Kickstarter accounts<\/strong> and place <strong>separate deposits<\/strong> using the same emails as those accounts.  <strong>Example:<\/strong> To get <strong>6 units at $129.99 each<\/strong>, place <strong>two deposits<\/strong> and back <strong>one 2-unit<\/strong> and <strong>one 4-unit<\/strong> Secret Reward tier using <strong>two Kickstarter accounts<\/strong>.<\/li><\/ul>","opened":false}},"accordion_d6TQrw":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"question":"Can I get an invoice for the deposit and final payment?","answer":"<p>Yes. After completing the payment, an invoice will be issued upon request. Please contact our customer service team at <a href=\"mailto:security.global@baseus.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:security.global@baseus.com\"><strong>security.global@baseus.com <\/strong><\/a>with your order number and billing details.<\/p>","opened":false}},"accordion_fXzRGH":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"question":"Can I transfer my deposit to someone else?","answer":"<p>No. Deposits are non-transferable. They are tied to the email address used for purchase and must match the Kickstarter account used to back the X1 Pro.<\/p>","opened":false}},"accordion_NFpN73":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"question":"Which countries can you ship to?","answer":"<p>We currently ship to the following regions and countries:<\/p><p><strong>United States, Canada, United Kingdom, Australia, Russia, Belarus, Republic of Moldova, Saudi Arabia, Israel, United Arab Emirates, Malaysia, Singapore, New Zealand, European Union (EU) Countries.<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> is available for <strong>multi-unit bundles<\/strong> to the <strong>United States, European Union, United Kingdom, Canada, Australia, and Switzerland<\/strong>.<\/p><p>For single-unit bundles or other regions, shipping fees will be shown at checkout on Kickstarter.<\/p><p>Taxes and duties may vary depending on your region.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","opened":false}},"accordion_QPQq4j":{"type":"accordion","settings":{"question":"Who can I contact if I have questions about my deposit order?","answer":"<p>Please reach out to our customer support team at <a href=\"mailto:security.global@baseus.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:security.global@baseus.com\"><strong>security.global@baseus.com<\/strong><\/a> with your order number and inquiry details.<\/p>","opened":false}}},"block_order":["accordio